{
  "tema": 6983,
  "slug": "subjuntivo-presente-e-ie-ir",
  "titulo": "Conjugate -ir verbs with e > ie in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "Sienta, prefiera, but sintamos: an extra change in nosotros.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "-ir verbs with e > ie change e > ie in the subjunctive, and e > i in nosotros: sienta, sientas, sintamos, sientan.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Stem-changing verbs (**e > ie**, **o > ue**) normally keep their change in the present subjunctive in every form except **nosotros**, where nothing changes."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**-ir** verbs with **e > ie** are different: in **nosotros** they change **e > i**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "preferir",
            "mentir",
            "sentir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "prefiera",
              "mienta",
              "sienta"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "prefieras",
              "mientas",
              "sientas"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "prefiera",
              "mienta",
              "sienta"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "prefiramos",
              "mintamos",
              "sintamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "prefieran",
              "mientan",
              "sientan"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The vowel that changes is the **e** closest to the end of the stem: **pref-e-rir** → **prefiera**, **prefiramos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Other verbs like this: **divertirse**, **sugerir**, **convertir**, **advertir**, **hervir**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **-ir** verbs never leave nosotros alone. If it isn't **ie**, it's **i**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
